   "subject": "Re: Convergence problems cfa",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Dear Yves,</div><div> </div><div>Thank you for your anwers.</div><div>I&#39;ve tried the MLR estimator, but this doesn&#39;t seem sufficient to solve my problems. It&#39;s probably the overlap between the factors, like you say. When adapting my first model with only unique indicators, the model convergenced. I still have to try if this also works for the other models.</div><div> </div><div>Thank you for your help,</div><div>Kathleen</div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
